  heading: Practically New, Top to Bottom
  paragraphs:
    - "Venture up into Forest Heights and you&rsquo;ll find a large home full of furniture and fine art that&rsquo;s barely been lived with. The owners had just finished furnishing the house &mdash; new Restoration Hardware sofas, chairs, and tables throughout, alongside vintage McGuire and Baker pieces &mdash; before a sudden passing left it all behind. There&rsquo;s no rubble to sort through here; everything is in excellent, like-new condition."
